                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "сноро́ви́стей"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ad958246-a986-339b-adf0-3bf32e0f788b",
                        "entry_id": "8d79d80f-d851-3aef-a8eb-fb5291575e20",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. отличающийся сноровкой; ловкий, умелый"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6527e74-3719-4eb7-9f20-c336f043cf9d",
                                "sense_id": "ad958246-a986-339b-adf0-3bf32e0f788b",
                                "text": "Как будто кем-то вынута из него живая душа и положена в долгий ящик, а на место ее вставлена не живая, но сноровистая суетилка."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "64f6fa8d-6408-4c08-9b18-4200f0e5f308",
                        "source_entry_id": "8d79d80f-d851-3aef-a8eb-fb5291575e20",
                        "source_sense_id": "ad958246-a986-339b-adf0-3bf32e0f788b",
                        "target_lang_word": "dexterous",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dexterous",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6623599e-958d-3e1d-b365-c13045719c89",
                                        "entry_id": "c7f00693-7984-35ff-bf0d-e987ea77a736",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Skillful with one's hands."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bc6878c-0142-44b0-ba38-6897aa84c86b",
                                                "sense_id": "6623599e-958d-3e1d-b365-c13045719c89",
                                                "text": "She is pleasingly dexterous with the chopsticks, and keeps one hand lying palm up on her lap. Pinched with just the right pressure between the sticks; funny how plump women have that delicate touch."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ddc51a6-8ce5-3423-8f2e-fc9853df3d0a",
                                        "entry_id": "c7f00693-7984-35ff-bf0d-e987ea77a736",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Skillful in some specific thing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc716185-28f5-4440-8404-6e1df5457dc7",
                                                "sense_id": "1ddc51a6-8ce5-3423-8f2e-fc9853df3d0a",
                                                "text": "We went frequently out with this boat a-fishing; and as I was most dexterous to catch fish for him, he never went without me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a85152bd-a6c3-37f0-b627-6abfb9c64fba",
                                        "entry_id": "c7f00693-7984-35ff-bf0d-e987ea77a736",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Agile; flexible; able to move fluidly and gracefully."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1611a869-de5f-3a66-a291-6ba17d090785",
                                        "entry_id": "c7f00693-7984-35ff-bf0d-e987ea77a736",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Skilled at argumentation; mentally skillful; quick-witted."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e82fb6c-4301-468f-af0c-da7412654de4",
                                                "sense_id": "1611a869-de5f-3a66-a291-6ba17d090785",
                                                "text": "1775, speech by Edmund Burke\n[…] the study [of law] renders men acute, inquisitive, dexterous, prompt in attack, ready in defense […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cafce2dc-1e40-4612-b578-3122a5ccba97",
                        "source_entry_id": "8d79d80f-d851-3aef-a8eb-fb5291575e20",
                        "source_sense_id": "ad958246-a986-339b-adf0-3bf32e0f788b",
                        "target_lang_word": "nimble",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nimble",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76aa094d-25cf-364a-814d-a7dac62751dc",
                                        "entry_id": "b4b7902b-e65a-342b-b2db-62a00a9c8edd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Adept at taking or grasping."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9ce1cea-d063-4313-a9fd-0ad117d88c93",
                                                "sense_id": "76aa094d-25cf-364a-814d-a7dac62751dc",
                                                "text": "nimble fingers"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2489507-92bc-3935-90e0-387a83ccbd4e",
                                        "entry_id": "b4b7902b-e65a-342b-b2db-62a00a9c8edd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Quick and light in movement or action."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08418ce5-b823-4d0b-8bde-f90f75e3af76",
                                                "sense_id": "e2489507-92bc-3935-90e0-387a83ccbd4e",
                                                "text": "He was too nimble for the assailant and easily escaped his grasp."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb528ec2-3575-407e-a028-4a48960e6a5b",
                                                "sense_id": "e2489507-92bc-3935-90e0-387a83ccbd4e",
                                                "text": "[…] if the men should not agree what to play, but one would have a grave Pavane, another a nimbler Galliard, a third some frisking toy or Iigg, and then all of them should be wilful, none yield to his fellow, but every one scrape on his own tune as loud as he could: what a hideous hateful noise may you imagine would such a mess of Musick be?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54121d34-3d76-4f31-b75f-8afdd00f15f9",
                                                "sense_id": "e2489507-92bc-3935-90e0-387a83ccbd4e",
                                                "text": "Attempts to introduce versions of \"market communism\" — in China, Hungary or Yugoslavia — have shown how hard it is to make mainly state-owned economies as nimble as mainly private ones."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a01e114e-6298-4431-834a-279f86e29d56",
                                                "sense_id": "e2489507-92bc-3935-90e0-387a83ccbd4e",
                                                "text": "The quickest and nimblest were probably the oxycones, throwing themselves through the water like discuses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3e468bf-dd70-305b-80c5-30fc27019c03",
                                        "entry_id": "b4b7902b-e65a-342b-b2db-62a00a9c8edd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Quickwitted and alert."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d543fa4a-f563-4a47-bf61-2a09f66a7bd5",
                                                "sense_id": "d3e468bf-dd70-305b-80c5-30fc27019c03",
                                                "text": "He has a nimble mind and can improvise in any situation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e48767e-c462-403b-af98-e87181d1c3e8",
                                                "sense_id": "d3e468bf-dd70-305b-80c5-30fc27019c03",
                                                "text": "\"It requires you to be flexible and nimble in your thinking and Huw has already demonstrated that,\" said Greenwood, [...]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "nimble",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f403a70-3037-3d6b-85db-27f5cb275e4e",
                                        "entry_id": "b7dfb3e0-8638-346a-8bcc-22b10dc0fe99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move nimbly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3505e9d-d585-4b56-b07a-568987d6ea8f",
                                                "sense_id": "0f403a70-3037-3d6b-85db-27f5cb275e4e",
                                                "text": "Their teeth are regularly and assiduously cleaned by shrimp that nimble in and out of the moray's mouth like ballet dancers in the jaws of a mechanical stage dragon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eb67915c-60f7-4f97-8f82-7fa027920d6c",
